    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the competition in this thrilling, 6v6 indoor volleyball game, built for players craving all the fast paced action and strategic depth the sport has to offer! Compete in Men's and Women's leagues with full customization controls of players, teams, and uniforms to craft your ultimate volleyball experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer Aces emphasizes fun-first gameplay, blending arcade style excitement with realistic volleyball mechanics. Streamlined controls are intuitive for new players while offering the layered, strategic depth savvy veterans will need to dominate from pin to pin! Utilize a variety of gameplay sliders and options to perfectly tune the challenge you'll face on the court or watching comfortably from the sidelines in Spectator mode. Got a second controller on hand? Team up with a friend to take on the AI in co-op or put your relationship to the test in a head to head, local multiplayer battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're ready to dig in deep, dive into Franchise Mode and take the reigns of an existing club or build your very own dynasty from scratch. Sign players, manage your roster, and develop your young talent into future aces! Control team finances, secure advertisers, upgrade facilities, and enhance your arena to boost fan engagement and revenue. How long can you stay on top of the volleyball world?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the competition in this thrilling, 6v6 indoor volleyball game, built for players craving all the fast paced action and strategic depth the sport has to offer! Compete in Men's and Women's leagues with full customization controls of players, teams, and uniforms to craft your ultimate volleyball experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer Aces emphasizes fun-first gameplay, blending arcade style excitement with realistic volleyball mechanics. Streamlined controls are intuitive for new players while offering the layered, strategic depth savvy veterans will need to dominate from pin to pin! Utilize a variety of gameplay sliders and options to perfectly tune the challenge you'll face on the court or watching comfortably from the sidelines in Spectator mode. Got a second controller on hand? Team up with a friend to take on the AI in co-op or put your relationship to the test in a head to head, local multiplayer battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're ready to dig in deep, dive into Franchise Mode and take the reigns of an existing club or build your very own dynasty from scratch. Sign players, manage your roster, and develop your young talent into future aces! Control team finances, secure advertisers, upgrade facilities, and enhance your arena to boost fan engagement and revenue. How long can you stay on top of the volleyball world?</p>",
    "short_description": "The ultimate 6v6 indoor volleyball game! Build a powerhouse from the ground up to challenge the greatest men's and women's clubs in the world!",
